OpenProvider

This software is derived from Cline (https://github.com/cline/cline),
Copyright (c) Cline Bot Inc., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This software has been modified from the original. Notable changes include:
- Rebranding from "Cline" to "OpenProvider" (extension identity, commands,
  views, icons, and user-facing text).
- Removal of the Cline-hosted account, authentication, and billing system
  (ClineAccount, ClinePass, credit balance, and related UI), which depended
  on Cline's own backend services.
- Removal of telemetry and error reporting integrations that sent data to
  Cline's infrastructure.
- Focus on free-tier API providers (NVIDIA Build, Groq, Cerebras, Gemini,
  OpenRouter).

